# recovery.wipe — AIO LIVE placeholder (intentionally empty).
# The stub-time swap (aioswap.c, post LGZ unpack, pre init) replaces this
# file with families/<fam>/recovery.wipe for the detected device. Empty
# is the safe direction (factory reset wipes nothing). If you read this
# text in a booted image, the swap did not run.
# Swap kit: system/etc/recovery.wipe.<fam> (shipped alongside).
